A train travels at a speed of 60 km/h. How much time will it take to cover a distance of 150 km?
A) 2 hours
B) 2 hours 15 minutes
C) 2 hours 30 minutes
D) 3 hours
Solution :
          distance = time * speed
          150 =T * 60
           T = 150/60
              = 2.5
              = 2 hours 30 minutes

Answer: C) 2 hours 30 minutes
